{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wish Upon A Llama</strong> is a cozy, role-playing game for animal lovers! As Llama Town's rancher, rekindle a forgotten bond between townsfolk and animals, and dedicate your time to providing whole-hearted love and care for generations of animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/626020f23717a1ae29467dd185d464b5.apng?t=1771192215\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/626020f23717a1ae29467dd185d464b5.poster.avif?t=1771192215\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=120 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals come in a variety of colors, patterns, and personalities. Baby animals inherit genetic traits from both parents, so you'll need to consider these factors as you breed them. Can you discover all 50+ special breeds?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your animals on walks anywhere you go to explore and enjoy the countryside together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook hearty, gourmet meals for your animals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/03035a4a90f6b3ec04ea6c38c1ddad40.poster.avif?t=1771192215\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/03035a4a90f6b3ec04ea6c38c1ddad40.webm?t=1771192215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and befriend wild animals across diverse landscapes -- maze-like forests, tropical beaches, serene fields, and more!  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultivate strong bonds with your companions through activities like gift-giving, playing fetch, bathing them, and enjoying mini-games like dancing together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help animals find their perfect home by connecting them with the right townsfolk -- you\u2019ll still see them around town and can check in on how they\u2019re doing!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/2e5dbafc41a40044621694d5805eb947.webp?t=1771192215\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/2e5dbafc41a40044621694d5805eb947.poster.avif?t=1771192215\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=785 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/85e0bc7a0c4b4973ae99a1ab67773b5f.apng?t=1771192215\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/85e0bc7a0c4b4973ae99a1ab67773b5f.poster.avif?t=1771192215\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=120 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Llama Town boasts a diverse population for you to meet! From the aspiring designer to the chill gamer, resilient immigrant, and determined engineer, encounter individuals with unique personalities and intriguing stories. Forge new friendships and perhaps discover romance. Challenge your friends to activities like jump rope, town cleaning, trivia games, spelling bees, and more -- there's never a dull moment in Llama Town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet our dateable characters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/073cd17367e12b718de22d106a8bcf49.avif?t=1771192215\" width=600 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other features \ud83e\udd70</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your own family and guide your children as they grow, attend school, and make friends, with the loving support of nearby grandparents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By facilitating animal adoptions into perfect homes, you\u2019ll help contribute to Llama Town\u2019s fundraising efforts, unlocking exciting new infrastructure and breathtaking locations like vacation islands, lush forests, and picturesque beaches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and personalize your dwelling and surrounding land. Fill them with decor to make your one-of-a-kind dream home</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/54760945377a088b63ef52a031e45132.poster.avif?t=1771192215\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/54760945377a088b63ef52a031e45132.webm?t=1771192215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/54760945377a088b63ef52a031e45132.mp4?t=1771192215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2262630?t=1771192215","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2262630?t=1771192215","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/eb2c4c88cc73395fbbd3c6c9ec9635b422789783/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771192215","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/eb2c4c88cc73395fbbd3c6c9ec9635b422789783/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771192215","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wish Upon A Llama</strong> is a cozy, role-playing game for animal lovers! As Llama Town's rancher, rekindle a forgotten bond between townsfolk and animals, and dedicate your time to providing whole-hearted love and care for generations of animals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/626020f23717a1ae29467dd185d464b5.apng?t=1771192215\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/626020f23717a1ae29467dd185d464b5.poster.avif?t=1771192215\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=120 /></picture></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals come in a variety of colors, patterns, and personalities. Baby animals inherit genetic traits from both parents, so you'll need to consider these factors as you breed them. Can you discover all 50+ special breeds?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your animals on walks anywhere you go to explore and enjoy the countryside together!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook hearty, gourmet meals for your animals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/03035a4a90f6b3ec04ea6c38c1ddad40.poster.avif?t=1771192215\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/03035a4a90f6b3ec04ea6c38c1ddad40.webm?t=1771192215\" typ