a Town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet our dateable characters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/073cd17367e12b718de22d106a8bcf49.avif?t=1771192215\" width=600 height=1000 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other features \ud83e\udd70</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your own family and guide your children as they grow, attend school, and make friends, with the loving support of nearby grandparents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By facilitating animal adoptions into perfect homes, you\u2019ll help contribute to Llama Town\u2019s fundraising efforts, unlocking exciting new infrastructure and breathtaking locations like vacation islands, lush forests, and picturesque beaches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity and personalize your dwelling and surrounding land. Fill them with decor to make your one-of-a-kind dream home</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/54760945377a088b63ef52a031e45132.poster.avif?t=1771192215\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/54760945377a088b63ef52a031e45132.webm?t=1771192215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2262630/extras/54760945377a088b63ef52a031e45132.mp4?t=1771192215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Millionhare Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_im